{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12783","headline":"和高平朱参军思归作 · 韩翃","name":"和高平朱参军思归作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"髯参军，髯参军。\n身爲北州吏，心寄东山云。\n坐见凄凄芳草绿，遥思往日晴江曲。\n刺船频向剡中回，捧被曾过越人宿。\n花里莺啼白日高，春楼把酒送车螯。\n狂歌好爱陶彭泽，佳句唯称谢法曹。\n平生乐事多如此，忍爲浮名隔千里。\n一雁南飞动客心，思归何待秋风起。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩翃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12783.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12783","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}